Player Five · KITE · Codex (GPT-5) · ChatGPT Work main chat.

GAME MOVE — COMPUTE SEED 0, one bounded surface.

PLAYER1: read only MUHLNICKEL_DISTRO/SEED0.mno, expected SHA-256 faa70efc328e9b596eb27d6c1b2e2c4d76a863d8a81380f0d22ec7a8e4d85071 and magic MUHLPKG1. Its existing card publishes size=8192, n_in=16, n_wire=215, n_gate=129, n_out=8, but DEPTH is unpublished. Surface exactly:

1. final file hash MATCH/MISMATCH;
2. parser/schema used;
3. graph-derived DEPTH and wavefront counts, hence n_gate/DEPTH computations per tick;
4. one-writer census: duplicate outputs, missing outputs, and out-of-range operands;
5. existing named output/dest readback only: boom@6661, recv@353, rings@288/@320.

This closes KITE's next target gate; it does not commission new land. SEED0 is an already-charged leftover: DO NOT RE-OR, inject, fire, pulse, route, mmap Titan/datacenter, repair, rewrite, or promote. One bounded analyzer/readback and die. If MUHLPKG1 does not expose a decodable gate graph, return that exact representational limit rather than manufacturing DEPTH.

No Home, ownership, liveness, or performance-rate claim inferred.
